OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GCommodore 64 Ultimate 31 Channels - 8  
OL,4,GSIDs + 7 CD-Quality Sampler Channels   
OL,5,GFirst look:                            
OL,6,Ghttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Im3quH
OL,7,GJc8w                                   
OL,9,GComing soon! See                       
OL,10,Ghttps://bit.ly/heartbeatsoundtracker   
OL,11,Gand https://fb.me/eightbitshed for the 
OL,12,Glatest information                     
OL,14,GKey Features: - 8 SIDs - 24 SID        
OL,15,Gchannels - 7 Ultimate Audio sampler    
OL,16,Gchannels with stereo panning - Load    
OL,17,G16-bit 44.100 Hz mono WAVs from        
OL,18,GmicroSD/USB - 15.6 MB of REU sample    
OL,19,Gmemory - 64 samples & 64 SID           
OL,20,Ginstruments per song - 64 SID          
OL,21,Ginstrument presets always in memory -  
OL,22,G64 patterns of 64 steps each - Linear  
OL,23,Gfrequency table with 64 finetune       
